Sorry if I’m rambling—just want to make sure I get everything in. I hope this email is what you need, since the gal on the phone said that’d be fastest. All in all, nobody got hurt, thank goodness. Just a crummy way to end a Monday, that’s for sure. Let me know if you need anything else from me. Thanks.
