["{
  "claim_text": "Hey, so I'm writing in because, honestly, I've never had to do this before, and I want to make sure I get it right. They told me to use this number—CLM-462584—when I emailed, so I hope that helps match everything up. This is James Johnson, by the way, reaching out about what happened yesterday. Sorry, I guess it was actually the day before—I keep losing track of the days now that it's August, and my kids are out of school. Anyway, the bump happened on Monday, which would have been the 25th, yeah? I'm reporting it now, Tuesday, August 26th. Not sure if it matters, but figured you might need the timeline. So, what happened was, I'm at that big shopping center lot—where there's always stray carts everywhere, and the lines on the pavement are super faded. I was backing out after picking up groceries at 4:00 pm or so. To be honest, my son kept asking me about dinner, and my phone was buzzing in the cupholder, and I swore I checked my mirrors, but suddenly there was this other car behind me and we collided. Felt like one of those slow-motion moments—nothing super dramatic, but enough to crunch up the back bumper and smash a taillight. The security guard was making his rounds and said he'd seen worse, which isn't much comfort when you've got your rear end bashed in. I took photos, but I'm not super great with that stuff—the sun was hitting just right, so you can't really see the scratches. I talked to the other driver and we traded info. I drove straight home afterwards, thinking it didn't look so bad, but when I got it checked, the body shop said repairs are going to run me $3038. That was a shocker since I thought it'd just be paint and maybe a lightbulb or something. Guess that's what happens these days. Sorry if I'm rambling—just want to make sure I get everything in. I hope this email is what you need, since the gal on the phone said that'd be fastest. All in all, nobody got hurt, thank goodness. Just a crummy way to end a Monday, that's for sure. Let me know if you need anything else from me. Thanks.",
  "claim": {
    "header": {
      "claim_id": "CLM-462584",
      "report_date": "2025-08-26",
      "incident_date": "2025-08-25",
      "reported_by": "James Johnson",
      "channel": "Email",
